{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>THIS IS A DEMO VERSION OF THE GAME.</u>\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143880/extras/35bcd06384ea55e4dffce78606ae92a9.avif?t=1763032094\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What's included in the <strong>demo</strong>?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 unique survivor encounters. The full game will have more survivors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infrared, notepad, healthcheck, shotgun and terminal tools.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0INCLUDES ONLY 5 DAYS INSTEAD OF 10 DAYS COMPARED TO THE FULL GAME.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 possible endings. The full game will have more endings and unlockable endings system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demo supported languages &gt; English.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full game will have more tools such as a radio and a\u00a0stethoscope. Those aren't included in the demo.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You</strong> are the quarantine gate\u2019s <strong>final barrier. </strong>Can you do your duty as a guard?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143880/extras/9757ca99311357b9a5d9fc799a823a5e.avif?t=1763032094\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143880/extras_big/9757ca99311357b9a5d9fc799a823a5e.webp?t=1763032094 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day, three strangers arrive \u2014 each with a story, a plea, and maybe\u2026 an infection. As the gate officer, decide under pressure: <strong>let them in, turn them away, or stop the threat</strong> before it spreads.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143880/extras/52864024312afc3559efb7c53d24a8dc.avif?t=1763032094\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143880/extras_big/52864024312afc3559efb7c53d24a8dc.webp?t=1763032094 width=1560 height=503 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your tools are scarce \u2014 and certainty doesn\u2019t exist:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infrared scans</strong> for fever and heat anomalies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Medical reports</strong> with wounds and suspicious bite marks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interrogation</strong> that exposes lies, panic, and manipulation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Terminal checks</strong> for name, age, priors, and past incidents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Notepad</strong> to track contradictions and hunches</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143880/extras/84d61b18bdf388f172e53e40eac17c75.avif?t=1763032094\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143880/extras_big/84d61b18bdf388f172e53e40eac17c75.webp?t=1763032094 width=1560 height=503 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some carriers <strong>mask symptoms perfectly</strong>.<br><strong>One bad decision can doom the district.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive <strong>ten days</strong> without a breach to piece together truths behind the outbreak\u2026 or watch your sector fall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143880/extras/1fa75b00e7694aac475915fbdc62dad2.avif?t=1763032094\" width=1438 height=810 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Moral deduction under pressure</strong> \u2014 make fast calls with incomplete data</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomized arrivals &amp; traits</strong> \u2014 high replayability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric pixel art</strong> \u2014 grounded UI, tense tone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings</strong> shaped by your performance and ethics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short \u201cdays,\u201d clear rhythm</strong> \u2014 three cases per day, strong \u201cone more day\u201d loop</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add to Wishlist and try the Demo!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demo feedback will shape tools and difficulty before release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143880/extras/98c931f4983cb8c9173f0f2ec0a442cd.avif?t=1763032094\" width=462 height=174 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4143880?t=1763032094","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143880/1bfdb2a30f39e894a2ff159337cb2f7f73da3b22/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763032094","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143880/213c33f0609c75ae1efe91211ecc0065a527fcaa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763032094","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143880/213c33f0609c75ae1efe91211ecc0065a527fcaa/