"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some carriers <strong>mask symptoms perfectly</strong>.<br><strong>One bad decision can doom the district.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive <strong>ten days</strong> without a breach to piece together truths behind the outbreak\u2026 or watch your sector fall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143880/extras/1fa75b00e7694aac475915fbdc62dad2.avif?t=1763032094\" width=1438 height=810 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Moral deduction under pressure</strong> \u2014 make fast calls with incomplete data</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomized arrivals &amp; traits</strong> \u2014 high replayability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric pixel art</strong> \u2014 grounded UI, tense tone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings</strong> shaped by your performance and ethics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short \u201cdays,\u201d clear rhythm</strong> \u2014 three cases per day, strong \u201cone more day\u201d loop</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add to Wishlist and try the Demo!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demo feedback will shape tools and difficulty before release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143880/extras/98c931f4983cb8c9173f0f2ec0a442cd.avif?t=1763032094\" width=462 height=174 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Wessi"],"fullgame":{"appid":"4133660","name":"Get In Get Out"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"descripti