x338.jpg?t=1763032094"},{"id":6,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143880/a29e93597e50a16b4bc6004f48703c9bb7772059/ss_a29e93597e50a16b4bc6004f48703c9bb7772059.1920x1080.jpg?t=1763032094","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143880/a29e93597e50a16b4bc6004f48703c9bb7772059/ss_a29e93597e50a16b4bc6004f48703c9bb7772059.600x338.jpg?t=1763032094"},{"id":7,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143880/c8633a143a16367d9920dbdddb2dfb2d0ff5e3cc/ss_c8633a143a16367d9920dbdddb2dfb2d0ff5e3cc.1920x1080.jpg?t=1763032094","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143880/c8633a143a16367d9920dbdddb2dfb2d0ff5e3cc/ss_c8633a143a16367d9920dbdddb2dfb2d0ff5e3cc.600x338.jpg?t=1763032094"}],"short_description":"DEMO VERSION. Pixel-art judgment game about trust and paranoia. Interrogate arrivals, scan for symptoms, and make moral calls as a guard. Let them in, turn them away, or stop the threat. Randomized traits, scarce tools, authoritarian regime, multiple endings. Add to your wishlist!","steam_appid":4143880,"support_info":{"email":"getingetoutgame@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"demo","website":null}